@startuml
title Document Lifecycle State Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
    ArrowColor Black
}

[*] --> Uploaded

Uploaded --> Registered : Metadata Stored

Registered --> Validating : Validate Document

Validating --> Processing : Validation Passed
Validating --> Rejected : Invalid Format

Processing --> Chunking : Parse Document

Chunking --> Embedding : Generate Embeddings

Embedding --> Indexed : Store in Qdrant

Indexed --> Available : Ready for Search

Available --> Updating : New Version Uploaded
Updating --> Processing : Re-ingest Document

Available --> Archived : Retention Policy

Archived --> Deleted : Permanent Removal

Rejected --> Deleted

Deleted --> [*]

@enduml